.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH stool-init 1  "stool-init "
.SH NAME
stool\-init \- Create a new configuration folder or reinitialize the existing one
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstool\-init\fR [\fB\-f\fR|\fB\-\-force\fR] [\fB\-C\fR|\fB\-\-clean\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Create a new configuration folder or reinitialize the existing one
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-f\fR, \fB\-\-force\fR
Force reinitialize configuration (overwrite existing)
.TP
\fB\-C\fR, \fB\-\-clean\fR
Clean and reinitialize (remove all existing data)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH EXTRA
For example:
  stool dotfile init https://github.com/YOUR_NAME/dotfiles
